<section class="scene scene--intro" aria-labelledby="ai-h">
  <div class="intro">
    <h1 id="ai-h">How we use AI</h1>
    <p class="lead">We do all the creative work. AI is a tool we use along the way.</p>
    <p class="teaser">We're a small team, and AI lets us spend our time on the parts that matter: the story, the art, the jokes.</p>
    <p class="dialogue">Erik: “{{ site.erikAiLine }}”</p>
  </div>
  <img class="sprite" src="/assets/erik/erik-talk.png" alt="Erik" width="272" height="464">
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="split-h">
  <h2 id="split-h">Who does what</h2>
  <div class="split">
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Made by us, by hand</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>The story, the characters and the jokes</li>
        <li>Every puzzle and how they connect</li>
        <li>All the pixel art and animation</li>
        <li>The dialogue, in Danish</li>
        <li>Music and sound</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Where AI helps</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Keeping our puzzle chart and decisions in order</li>
        <li>Reading the story and puzzles and pointing out what doesn't work</li>
        <li>Checking grammar and spelling in our dialogue, never writing it</li>
        <li>Sparring with us on programming the game</li>
        <li>Building this website's infrastructure</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="rules-h">
  <h2 id="rules-h">Our house rules</h2>
  <ol class="rules">
    <li>The AI doesn't come up with ideas unless we ask. When we do ask, its ideas are marked as its own.</li>
    <li>The AI points out problems. Fixing them is our job.</li>
    <li><em>No</em> AI-made art, music, sound or dialogue in the game.</li>
    <li>If any of this changes, this page changes too.</li>
  </ol>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="tools-h">
